{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_35638","headline":"赋得寒月寄齐已 · 李山甫","name":"赋得寒月寄齐已","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"松下清风吹我襟，上方钟磬夜沉沉。\n已知庐岳尘埃绝，更忆寒山雪月深。\n高谢万缘消祖意，朗吟千首亦师心。\n岂知名出徧诸夏，石上栖禅竹影侵。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李山甫","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_35638.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_35638","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}